  "content": "<p>用於創建多面地毯的簡單庫。</p>\n<p>功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>包含一個可放置在地面/牆壁/天花板上的多部件方塊基類；</li>\n<li>實現了將方塊替換為多部件方塊的邏輯；</li>\n<li>提供模型/方塊狀態/戰利品表的數據生成輔助工具；</li>\n<li>支持 NeoForge/Fabric。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心理念是什麼？使用此庫，您可以快速且高效地創建平面多部件方塊。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1140721.svg\" alt=\"versions\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/blob/main/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"neoforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"fabric\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"quilt\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_64h.png\" alt=\"forge\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcarpets-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"patreon-singular\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\" alt=\"kofi-singular\"></a></p>\n<p>我的整合包：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblewatch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/kg0VTRKw/Untitled-125.jpg\" alt=\"cobblewatch\"></a></p>\n<p>查看我的其他模組：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G1XpmL4.png\" alt=\"carpet-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c2kJqYK/copperdeco125.png\" alt=\"copper-deco\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-loot-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n1X16BM.png\" alt=\"mob-loot-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-block-sounds-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epM9STT.png\" alt=\"better-block-sounds-fork\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slime-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/7LPXcWkr/so-logo-mini.png\" alt=\"slime-overhaul\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polyglot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3RCh0RZ/polyglot-mini.jpg\" alt=\"polyglot\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/hytale/mods/weapon-mastery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/C1fM4HHC/WM125.jpg\" alt=\"weapon-mastery\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NMB0gG5S/icon.png\" alt=\"bigwater\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-raid-den-icons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/fywpGqft/cri.png\" alt=\"cobblemon-raid-den-icons\"></a></p>",
